<view
  class="page"
>
  <view
    class="section-head"
  >
    <view>
      <view
        class="section-title"
      >成长诗分享卡</view>
      <view
        class="small"
      >一份温柔的成长纪念</view>
    </view>
    <view
      class="tag"
    >{{showName?'昵称分享':'匿名分享'}}</view>
  </view>
  <state-view
    status="{{status}}"
    title="{{status==='empty'?'没有可分享的诗文':''}}"
    message="{{error || '请返回阅读页选择一首诗。'}}"
    actionText="{{status==='empty'?'返回阅读':'重试'}}"
    bind:retry="load"
    bind:action="back"
  />
  <block
    wx:if="{{status==='ready'}}"
  >
    <view
      class="share-paper"
    >
      <image
        class="poem-cover share-cover"
        src="/assets/landscape.svg"
        mode="aspectFill"
      />
      <view
        class="poem-reading"
      >
        <view
          class="eyebrow"
        >{{showName?'写给'+(poem.student_name||'你'):'给正在长大的你'}}</view>
        <view
          class="poem-title"
        >{{poem.title}}</view>
        <view
          class="verse"
        >{{poem.content}}</view>
      </view>
      <view
        class="share-bottom row between"
      >
        <view>
          <view
            class="serif brand"
          >拾光育苗</view>
          <view
            class="small"
          >成长有迹，心自成诗</view>
          <view
            class="metadata"
          >AI 生成诗文 · 品牌插画</view>
        </view>
        <view
          class="stamp serif"
        >拾光
育苗</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <checkbox-group
      bindchange="toggle"
    >
      <label
        class="check-row"
      >
        <checkbox
          value="name"
          checked="{{showName}}"
          color="#c0392b"
        />
        <text>在卡片上显示孩子昵称（分享前确认授权）</text>
      </label>
    </checkbox-group>
    <view
      class="notice"
    >当前仅提供卡片预览，你可以使用设备截图功能自行保存。长内容请分段截图，分享前确认已获得适用授权。</view>
  </block>
</view>
